                                "sense_id": "1efad788-f6f5-343d-a1da-09d56d0e801c",
                                "text": "De tocht, die twee tot drie uur duurt, is verre van gewoontjes.",
                                "translation": "The journey of about two to three hours is quite out of the ordinary.",
                                "english": "The journey of about two to three hours is quite out of the ordinary."
